{"type":"record","name":"FootprintOutcome","namespace":"com.optionsedge.contracts.footprint","doc":"Canonical CVD footprint export. All prices/cells use exact integer cents, tick/contract/count/time fields use long. The JSON vocabulary, trading meaning and Kafka key are preserved. Avro-only new writes; explicit compatible readers also accept retained JSON during same-topic roll-forward.","fields":[{"name":"schemaVersion","type":"long"},{"name":"symbol","type":"string"},{"name":"timeframe","type":"string"},{"name":"sessionDate","type":"string"},{"name":"params","type":{"type":"record","name":"FootprintParams","fields":[{"name":"valueAreaPct","type":"long"},{"name":"imbalanceRatioPermille","type":"long"},{"name":"imbalanceMinContracts","type":"long"},{"name":"stackMin","type":"long"},{"name":"maxImbalancesPerBar","type":"long"},{"name":"maxStacksPerBar","type":"long"},{"name":"levelTicks","type":"long"},{"name":"zoneTicks","type":"long"},{"name":"historyBars","type":"long"},{"name":"maxSwings","type":"long"},{"name":"swingPullbackTicks","type":"long"},{"name":"zoneMinKnownContracts","type":"long"},{"name":"zoneMaxUnknownBps","type":"long"},{"name":"minKnownContracts","type":"long"},{"name":"maxUnknownBps","type":"long"},{"name":"dominanceBps","type":"long"},{"name":"absorptionMinBandContracts","type":"long"},{"name":"absorptionMaxPenetrationTicks","type":"long"},{"name":"absorptionMinRejectionTicks","type":"long"},{"name":"absorptionWindowMinBandContracts","type":"long"},{"name":"absorptionMinTestBars","type":"long"},{"name":"absorptionWindowMaxPenetrationTicks","type":"long"},{"name":"exhaustionMinPushes","type":"long"},{"name":"exhaustionMaxPermille","type":"long"},{"name":"comparisonMinContracts","type":"long"},{"name":"persistToleranceTicks","type":"long"},{"name":"persistMinBars","type":"long"},{"name":"persistLookbackBars","type":"long"},{"name":"outcomeHorizonBars","type":"long"},{"name":"outcomeTicks","type":"long"},{"name":"maxLevelsPerBar","type":"long"},{"n